I can add one further bit of advice for Wizards - the thing which
really made a difference for me and finally got me to ascend one.  You
must collect uncursed daggers in the early game (orc, elven or normal -
it doesn't matter at first) and practice using and throwing them.  The
quarterstaff is pretty useless as a weapon, but once you advance in the
daggers skill thrown daggers are lethal.  Many players ascend with a
pile of +7 blessed rustproof daggers as projectile weapons.

